@RetailPOS.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5005
@superAdminToken = supply-locally-do-not-save-a-real-token
@businessId = 1

### Company-controlled UI date format (authenticated; no settings administration permission needed)
GET {{RetailPOS.API_HostAddress}}/api/settings/formatting
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}

### Unauthenticated date-format request: 401
GET {{RetailPOS.API_HostAddress}}/api/settings/formatting

### Explicit Business selection (active persisted Super Admin and active Business required)
POST {{RetailPOS.API_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/business-context
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"businessId": {{businessId}}}

### Every scoped request independently revalidates the selected Business
GET {{RetailPOS.API_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}
X-Business-Id: {{businessId}}

### Clear selection without choosing a default Business
POST {{RetailPOS.API_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/business-context
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"businessId": null}

### Invalid positive-ID contract: 400
POST {{RetailPOS.API_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/business-context
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"businessId": -1}

### Missing/inactive Business: 403
POST {{RetailPOS.API_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/business-context
Authorization: Bearer {{superAdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"businessId": 9223372036854775807}
